n though the acting  takes cinematography and well everything  would be better however my jaw dropped  to the floor when i realized that the  league were actually gonna lose unable  to separate the mother boxes we got a  scene which completely changed what i  thought was gonna be a predictable  ending and it took things in a brand new  direction  now at this point the unity was complete  and the world was about to be  terraformed into an apocalypse-like  planet which would render it a complete  wasteland this vision had been predicted  by cyborg when the league were about to  resurrect superman and for a split  second i actually believe that this  would set up the nightmare scenario  however something changed blast you had  been knocked out of action stood up and  he raised his hand defiantly to stop the  incoming wave this is something that the  characters symbolically did throughout  the movie and just before the car hit  victor stone and his mother he raised  his hand up which was murdered when his  father died too it's very much a gesture  put in place by snyder to show the  heroes defiantly attempting to stop what  is about to happen however whereas  victor failed the flash was able to tap  into the speed force at this moment and  completely change the events of history  flash healed himself at super speed and  then uttered the following words  just gotta go faster than the speed of  light far beyond the speed of light  gotta break the rule barry and you gotta  do it  in justice league flash had been used to  escort a russian family out of the area  here he was a god able to control time  destiny and fate as the character rushed  towards the unity i got goosebumps  seeing him race back in time as the  world rebuilt itself around him this was  an absolutely outstanding moment that  took him from being a secondary  speedster character to one of the best  of the best of the best so now watching  this scene back i think it's incredible  how as he races back to the 